Subject: [PATCH 26/30] hw/virtio: add virtio-msg linux bridge transport parent

Add the composite transport parent that wires virtio-msg to the linux
bridge backend.

Keep the patch scoped to parent creation and machine/FDT integration.

Signed-off-by: Bertrand Marquis <bertrand.marquis@arm.com>
---
